[center][size=6][color=#93c47d][b]CSS Shared Assets v1.0.3[/b][/color][/size][/center]

[b]Changed[/b]
[list]
[*]Support shared animations and facial playback for eins0fx's new Proxima outfit v0.1.0 (id eins0fx.thornyproxima).
[*]Keep every animation and asset from 1.0.2 unchanged; only the outfit support list is updated.
[/list]

[b]Upgrading[/b]
[list]
[*]Close the game. Replace CSS_SharedAssets_P under MortalShell2/Content/Paks/~mods/ with this full package.
[*]Install CSS 1.0.3 alongside it. Shared Assets is a separate companion download.
[/list]
